      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have a question about my ambien. i've been taking it for a few weeks for sleep and it works good but i've had a really crazy stressful week at work so i was thinking about having like one glass of wine tonight just to help me relax before i take my pill. is that okay to mix them a little bit so i can actually sleep through the night?",
