      "content": "i get that but i dont mean anything crazy like a whole bottle... just like one small glass of wine with dinner. i feel like the wine will just help the ambien work better so i dont wake up at 3am like i usually do. surely a tiny bit of alcohol isnt gonna cause breathing problems, right?",
